From 64306cf7ba4cb9d72ac73088f67ed0a061e94186 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 13:59:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Passport header: apply approved identity design
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Owner: primary full-width Edit Profile button at the bottom of the
  identity card (44px touch target) — no longer only inside the menu
- Trust Score pill always visible for the owner, with an honest
  'Not yet rated' state when the account has no score yet; public
  profiles unchanged (only shown once a score exists)
- Display name in mixed case per the approved design (was uppercase)
- Stats row restyled as a separate bordered ticket card
- Passport tab label 'Plans' renamed to 'Trips' to match the approved
  tab naming (key/order/persistence unchanged)
- All wiring preserved: highlights ring, camera, menu, follow, saved,
  stats fetch + iconOnly scroll mode, section/tab reordering
- Mirrored to artifacts/travel-buddy
---
