  identity card, watermark-style (opacity 0.3, pointerEvents none)
- Threshold: WORLD_TRAVELER_MIN_COUNTRIES = 5
- Owner: countries from passport stats, reported up from the existing
  PassportStatsRow fetch via onStatsLoaded (no duplicate query)
- Public passports: countries derived from the already-computed distinct
  postcard countries, so visitors see the achievement too
- Mirrored to artifacts/travel-buddy
